H29 sign pass B (Opus vision, 28 Sept 2026, prompt scripts/PROMPTS.md "H29 sign passes", independent of pass A). Rows verbatim except the segment column stored as 1..4. It flags the same four duplicate segment images (L04_s4 = L03_s4, L05_s2 = L04_s2, L06_s4 = L05_s4, L07_s1 = L06_s1) but, unlike pass A, RE-LISTS the duplicated segments under the second band (its rows L04 25-32, L06 38, L07 1-12 are the same signs as L03 36-43, L05 24, L06 1-12), so its band totals over-count. Counts as reported: L01 36, L02 44, L03 43, L04 32, L05 24, L06 38, L07 44.
